WEBVTT

NOTE Solstice Media — renewal conversation

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Dana Whitfield>Renewal is in six weeks. Anything I should know before we get to paperwork?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Bea Lindqvist>The honest answer is that adoption stalled. We bought it for the whole editorial team, and it is really only the data desk using it. Part of that is training, part of it is that everyone else lives in the CMS and will not switch tabs twenty times a day.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
<v Bea Lindqvist>If it appeared inside the CMS, that argument disappears overnight.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
<v Dana Whitfield>We have an embed API. Would the CMS team have capacity to wire it up?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
<v Bea Lindqvist>Maybe in Q3. They are heads-down on the paywall migration until then.
